WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:03.070
<b>Healthcare runs on information</b>

00:03.070 --> 00:06.200
<b>that arrives too late. Roles, tenders,</b>

00:06.200 --> 00:07.760
<b>budgets and people,</b>

00:07.760 --> 00:09.490
<b>scattered everywhere.</b>

00:10.300 --> 00:13.080
<b>Qura brings it into one place. Live, every day.</b>

00:17.800 --> 00:19.890
<b>For hospitals and providers:</b>

00:19.890 --> 00:23.830
<b>search clinicians who are already checked, qualified,</b>

00:23.830 --> 00:25.250
<b>and ready to start.</b>

00:28.800 --> 00:30.470
<b>For workforce suppliers:</b>

00:30.470 --> 00:33.110
<b>see live demand the moment it appears,</b>

00:33.110 --> 00:35.690
<b>and reach the named people behind it.</b>

00:36.300 --> 00:37.810
<b>And for SEND specialists:</b>

00:37.810 --> 00:39.800
<b>every special school's vacancies,</b>

00:39.800 --> 00:41.300
<b>tenders and council need.</b>

00:44.400 --> 00:45.970
<b>For medical suppliers:</b>

00:45.970 --> 00:48.340
<b>know the day a new service opens,</b>

00:48.340 --> 00:50.480
<b>and reach the buyer before the</b>

00:50.480 --> 00:51.770
<b>tender is written.</b>

00:55.400 --> 00:58.340
<b>For GP practices and care providers:</b>

00:58.340 --> 01:00.960
<b>fill sessions and shifts faster,</b>

01:00.960 --> 01:03.170
<b>and stay ahead of your ICB.</b>

01:06.400 --> 01:07.480
<b>For clinicians:</b>

01:07.480 --> 01:08.780
<b>get verified once,</b>

01:08.780 --> 01:10.580
<b>on the official register,</b>

01:10.580 --> 01:12.950
<b>and be seen by every hospital and</b>

01:12.950 --> 01:14.180
<b>supplier on Qura.</b>

01:14.180 --> 01:15.260
<b>No agency fees.</b>

01:19.000 --> 01:21.510
<b>Every organisation is checked too.</b>

01:21.510 --> 01:23.730
<b>Built on checks, before scale.</b>

01:25.200 --> 01:28.890
<b>One platform. Every lens. Choose yours.</b>
